       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IF-ELSE-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STUDENT-MARKS PIC 999 VALUE 72.
       01 ACCOUNT-BALANCE PIC 9(6) VALUE 2500.
       01 WITHDRAWAL-AMOUNT PIC 9(6) VALUE 3000.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF STUDENT-MARKS >= 40
               DISPLAY "RESULT: PASS"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "RESULT: FAIL"
           END-IF.
           IF WITHDRAWAL-AMOUNT > ACCOUNT-BALANCE
               DISPLAY "WITHDRAWAL DECLINED"
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT WITHDRAWAL-AMOUNT FROM ACCOUNT-BALANCE
               DISPLAY "NEW BALANCE: " ACCOUNT-BALANCE
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
